f2dqF9\/zDN2pDTWr5s\/4Iqf8ABLfxj+y94g+Inx6\/aF8OQ6V8WI9S1D4e\/D7SBcfaR4f0fT\/tmla\/4otbm1OM+Mftn2Gx\/wBPP+gabkDThqWV9x8A\/s0ftT654ck+H\/hTwZ+z5\/wTs+DGqRGLxF4a\/ZLt7rxh8b\/FsGP+PQfEa58H+A\/DXhvjOL8pkZYAtuwn7IfDzRZPDPhrRvDkX9pSad4f03T9Is5tZ1DUtY1e4gsLZbYG61TVbu8vry9HW9vr6\/v7\/UBk\/MQhir\/l3\/X8x9DT4kzrB5RVyWpW\/wCE7Eu2ltbddFo\/wfR63P\/Z","name":"Lasagna","steps":[{"uuid":"3213A1DE-9B66-4AEA-9A84-2D260EE439F1","isSection":false,"order":0,"step":"Preheat the oven to 350°F. Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil. Add the lasagna noodles and cook until al dente (firm) according to package directions. Drain, rinse under cold water, and set aside."},{"uuid":"079909D9-A5E0-4111-A6D4-ACA1360E36E7","isSection":false,"order":1,"step":"Meanwhile, in a large skillet or Dutch oven, brown the beef, sausage, onion, and garlic over medium-high heat until no pink remains. Drain any fat."},{"uuid":"E1FDD114-9DE7-4CA8-996D-0FBE9BC19B2E","isSection":false,"order":2,"step":"Stir in the pasta sauce, tomato paste, Italian seasoning,  ½  teaspoon of salt, and  ¼  teaspoon of black pepper. Simmer uncovered over medium heat for 5 minutes or until slightly thickened.  Taste and season with additional salt if desired."},{"uuid":"6ADDEA54-DD4F-483D-B3B1-86544FDEA3B0","isSection":false,"order":3,"step":"In a separate medium bowl, combine  1 ½  cups mozzarella cheese,  ¼  cup parmesan cheese, ricotta, parsley, egg, and  ¼  teaspoon salt."},{"uuid":"75A7E5E8-3629-447E-B655-E6195CE36E22","isSection":false,"order":4,"step":"Spread 1 cup of the meat sauce in a 9x13 pan or casserole dish. Top it with 3 lasagna noodles. Layer with 1 cup of the ricotta cheese mixture and 1 cup of meat sauce.  Repeat twice more. Finish with 3 noodles topped with remaining sauce."},{"uuid":"FEF63C07-6FAA-4DE0-A172-33CC53D70F59","isSection":false,"order":5,"step":"Cover with foil and bake for 45 minutes."},{"uuid":"52EA4AC9-748D-49CC-B731-9FA05CD50D1D","isSection":false,"order":6,"step":"Remove the foil and sprinkle the top of the lasagna with 2 ½ cups mozzarella cheese and ¼ cup Parmesan cheese. Bake uncovered for an additional 15 minutes or until browned and bubbly. Broil for 2-3 minutes if desired."},{"order":7,"uuid":"EFA2C798-DE43-406F-80A4-5971BA8C12AE","step":"Rest for at least 15 minutes before cutting.","isSection":false}],"folderIDs":[],"neutritionalInfo":"Protein: 29 g,\nCarbohydrates: 28 g,\nCholesterol: 71 mg,\nFiber: 2 g,\nSodium: 857 mg,\nFat: 16 g,\nSugar: 4 g,\nSaturated Fat: 7 g,\nServing Size: 1 serving,\nCalories: 377 kcal","isPublicRecipe":false,"defaultScale":1,"sourceName":"spendwithpennies.com"}